<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag, said it raised its indicative zinc price to 8,770 francs per tonne on Friday,</p>
<p>The last change was to 8,380 francs on May 14.</p>
<p>In a statement the company linked the move to recent developments in zinc and dollar prices.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom 6331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
